{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/169546-which-famous-people-would-you-like-to-see-in-the-wod-cannon","id":169546,"title":"Which famous people would you like to see in the WoD cannon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-15T00:13:33-07:00","id":169546,"title":"Which famous people would you like to see in the WoD cannon?","content":"was watching 24 hour party people and i always wondered how would Ian Curtis be on the Wraith Canon...that made me think, which famous people, actors, writters, artists etc... would you like to be part of the WoD cannon and how? what they would be and how they would become that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T04:20:31-07:00","id":169691,"title":"","content":"Carter Stanley, the talented bluegrass guitarist and vocalist would work great as either a Wraith or a Toreador vampire. I love his music and it helps that he's from the same part of Virginia I'm from!<br /> <br /> Another one I'd like to see is John Forbes Nash as a Sons of Ether mage.<br /> <br /> Jesco White as a Malkavian vampire or Marauder mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T11:37:41-07:00","id":169949,"title":"","content":"Let see.<br /> <br /> Vampire - Bill Nigh, William DeFoe, Elisa Hansen (she recently got married so I don't know if her name changed or not), Allison Preglar<br /> Werewolf (Excluding Slipknot and Stan Lee) - Brian Thompson, Doug Walker, Richard &quot;Old Man&quot; Harrison (P:T), Val Kilmer (Bastet or Pentex), Anthony Hopkins, Benicio Del Toro, Anna Paquin, Josh Hardnett, David Duchovny, Gillian Anderson, Mitch Peliggi<br /> Mage - Nicholas Cage, James Rolfe, Peter Cushing, Lewis Lovhaug, Noah Antwiler, Mara Wilson, Sir Ian McKellen, Patrick Stewart, Lance Hendrickson<br /> Wraith - Micheal Keaton, Phelan Porteous, Chris Sarandon, Bill Cosby, Elvira Mistress of Darkness<br /> Changeling - Lindsay Ellas, Kyle Kallgren, David Hyde Pierce, Robin Williams<br /> Mummy - Boris Karloff the Uncanny, Vincent Perez, Arnold Volsoo<br /> Hunter - Eric Rodriguez, Peter Cushing, Anthony Hopkins, Billy Conolly, Christopher Lee<br /> Demon - Ron Pearlmen, Kelsey Grammer, Micheal Wincott","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T13:29:34-07:00","id":170071,"title":"","content":"<b>On Demo's picks:</b><br /> <b>Werewolf:</b> Doug Walker (<i>Agree there, but I think he would be under Pentex.</i>)<br /> <b>Mage: </b>Noah Antwiler (<i>Going to have to disagree, while Dr. Insano would count towards that, Noah talks a lot about V:tM on his Counter Monkey Vlogs. He also tends to go for Bard characters in RPGs.</i>)<br /> <b>Wraith</b>: Phelan Porteous (<i>Risen</i>)<br /> <br /> Lewis Lovhaug would work for either Mage or Werewolf. Since Pollo can easily be a Mage Familiar or Tech Spirit. Joe &quot;Angry&quot; Vargas would work for Werewolf or Hunter. Paw Dugan: Werewolf or Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T14:41:21-07:00","id":170131,"title":"","content":"ok i got a quick question here, i was watching michael jackson videos (both Thriller and Ghosts)... and i been trying to figure out his arcanois, passions and fetters xD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T19:26:07-07:00","id":170335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/169546-which-famous-people-would-you-like-to-see-in-the-wod-cannon?p=170071#post170071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lewis Lovhaug would work for either Mage or Werewolf. Since Pollo can easily be a Mage Familiar or Tech Spirit. Joe &quot;Angry&quot; Vargas would work for Werewolf or Hunter. Paw Dugan: Werewolf or Changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lewis I would put in for Wraith since his gun would be a Wraith Relic, but went Mage since he's more Technocrat than anybody. Joe I wasn't sure. Paw would be a ghoul since I've been joking about it on and off over at That Guy. Kinda surprised that you haven't suggested Allison for Werewolf.<br /> <br /> @ Crowley:<br /> Bastet Micheal: Cecilian or Bagheera. Leaning more fore Cecilian from the look of the special fx.<br /> Zombie Micheal: Who knows how Risen work?<br /> Ghost Micheal: Passion (kids, other than obvious joke the kids are symbolic of his fans), Fetter (costumes I think), Arcanoi (Argos 3 dots. Castigate 1 dot, Embody 5 dots, Keening 5 dots, Outrage 2 dots, Pandemonium 2 dots, Puppetry 3 dots). That's my best guess, and from watching Phil Bunny's review of Ghosts once.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":1442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","user":"PaladinDemo","date":". 06-15-2014, 10:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T19:58:58-07:00","id":170354,"title":"","content":"SFDebris would be a Void Engineer. Or possibly a very skilled NWO operative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3200-barachiel","name":"Barachiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3200_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T06:06:50-07:00","id":170657,"title":"","content":"In my world Snoop Dogg is a powerful member of the Cult of Ecstasy, who actually spends the majority of his time directing the Ascension War (pre-Reckoning) in the western US.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T08:18:23-07:00","id":171659,"title":"","content":"Charlie Sheen. It would explain <b>so much</b> about him.<br /> <br /> By that reasoning, Angelina Jolie, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T09:48:04-07:00","id":171705,"title":"","content":"Donald Trump: Pentex Director and Skin Dancer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I had a conscience once. Alas, I appear to have misplaced it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1309-andreas-rayne","name":"Andreas Rayne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T14:22:45-07:00","id":172034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Andreas Rayne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/169546-which-famous-people-would-you-like-to-see-in-the-wod-cannon?p=171705#post171705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Donald Trump: Pentex Director and Skin Dancer.</div> </div> </div> </div>you know...i always thought his hair piece was Something","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T14:27:43-07:00","id":172038,"title":"","content":"None. It only dates the game. Now it's different if you're talking about historical people, but even then you have to be really careful or you end up with something ridiculous, offensive or both. (Heinrich Himmler anyone? Rasputin?) I think overall it's best to leave that kind of thing to individual chronicles, because tastes will vary from table to table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher","name":"Schleiermacher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T20:52:33-07:00","id":172341,"title":"","content":"...will I be flamed out if I really, <i>really</i> thoroughly dislike using real historical personalities in my roleplaying games? It's incredibly hard to do well and usually ends up more like <i>Assassin's Creed</i>'s tendency to go LOOK, A HISTORICAL PERSONA TO REMIND YOU THAT THIS IS SET IN HISTORY rather than anything constructive. It doesn't help that I loathe <i>&quot;X thing was actually due to Vampirie/Mage/alien/Templar influence!&quot; </i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T05:18:20-07:00","id":172646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/169546-which-famous-people-would-you-like-to-see-in-the-wod-cannon?p=172341#post172341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...will I be flamed out if I really, <i>really</i> thoroughly dislike using real historical personalities in my roleplaying games?</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope not, that would be pretty lame. While I think a nod or two in a game is fine to help set the tone, I also share the opinion that it is really hard to do well with very little payoff and likely undermines the idea that normal people had anything to do with history. I'm a hypocrite and ran a game where one player was a Gangrel musician, each scene was inspired around a song by <i>The Doors</i> to the point where I had them written down and researched the songs a bit to pick the perfect one for the right vibe.<br /> <br /> Character never met his sire and I will never say yes or no as to if his sire was Jim Morrison, some mysteries need to go on long after the game ends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3197-david-michael-felt","name":"David Michael Felt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T04:22:36-07:00","id":173975,"title":"","content":"Well, when it comes to cannon, the writers have to restrain themselves, obviously...<br /> <br /> but when it comes to personal games, IMHO all bets are off. If you think it would be cool for the players to discover that the JFK assassination was a joint venture between the NWO and Iteration X to put the president's brain into a cybernetic body, because the world wasn't ready for an awakened president... then WHY NOT? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}